    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> Borrow the Flames, and you must be utilizing Inferno Style</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1-3 Focus</p><p>Your martial practice and arcane knowledge of fire have come to harmonize with each other, and you know how to flow from one to the other.</p><p>When you make a casting check for a spell with the <strong>Fire</strong> trait, you may spend up to <strong>3 Focus</strong>, before or after rolling: you gain <strong>+1 bonus Expertise</strong> on that check per <strong>Focus</strong> spent.</p><p>Additionally, ending your turn after casting a spell with the <strong>Fire</strong> trait activates <em>Channel the Flames</em> from <strong><em>Inferno Style</em></strong>, granting you an additional <strong>+1 Focus</strong>.</p>",
